 "_doc": "Positive allowlist of chain steps a hooks pack def may use (site/packs-hooks.js; docs/PACK_SPEC.md 5.2). A method not listed is rejected with E_PACK_HOOKS_INVALID. The file never widens the runtime: the method must also exist on Pattern.prototype. Review rule: a method is listed only if it is (a) a control or structure method that takes numbers or strings, (b) used by a shipped hooks def or documented in site/data/intellisense/strudel.json, and (c) NOT one that compiles or evaluates text (bbexpr, byteBeatExpression, workletSrc, kabel, ...), speaks, draws or adds DOM nodes or window globals (pianoroll, scope, spectrum, punchcard, draw*, ...), loads samples or URLs, registers methods, logs, touches storage / MIDI / OSC / serial, or takes a function (every, off, jux, sometimes, apply, fmap, bind*, with*). To propose a step: add it here with its args shapes in a PR that also names the shipped def or documented use, and the reviewer applies the rule above.",
